WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.222
Instructions and data should be clearly separated.

00:00:03.222 --> 00:00:12.802
Delimiters, labeled fields, or structured formats make it easier for the model to distinguish what it should do from the

00:00:12.802 --> 00:00:18.867
content it should analyze. This becomes especially important when external or untrusted text enters the prompt.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:26.752
This separation also supports security because retrieved or user-provided text should not be confused with trusted

00:00:26.752 --> 00:00:28.899
application instructions.
